  "description": "One-bar intake leads to three eight-bar panels in triple meter. A curled G-Ab-G-Eb figure is answered by the reverse-contour Eb-D-Eb-G cell. The middle opens into relative-major sunlight; the returning cell enters half a beat late while bass remains anchored. The G-pedal preparations in bars 8 and 25 alternate dominant and tonic-minor color. Final B4 resolves harmonically into the tonic intake, whose melody rests then unfolds G4-C5. 45.918 seconds, complete uncut phrases.",
